<title>HONG KONG: Carr Indosuez set Henderson Land warrants.</title>
<headline>Carr Indosuez set Henderson Land warrants.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Carr Indosuez Asia (Derivatives) Ltd said on Tuesday it has issued 40 million American-style call warrants on shares of Henderson Land Development Co Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$65.925    PREMIUM	 9.58 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$1.434     GEARING	 5.11x</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  19.NOV.97    MIN EXER LOT  10,000</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE    HK$73.25</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
